sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as You
    participant A as Your agent
    box rgba(99,102,241,0.10) jevway
        participant J as jevway<br/>MCP server · CLI
    end
    participant M as Jev<br/>TypeSafe API
    participant C as Chrome tab

    U->>A: "Find a stay in Lisbon and open the best-rated one"
    A->>J: jevway_task(goal, values, done_when)
    loop every step, about 300 ms
        J->>C: read the page: listed controls + visible text
        J->>M: one decision request
        M-->>J: operation · listed element · value key · risk
        J->>C: act with real input events
    end
    Note over J: done only after a separate<br/>check of done_when passes
    J-->>A: one summary: status · url · page_text · steps
    Note over A,C: chrome-devtools can inspect the same tab at any time
